sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User / UI
  participant G as Gateway
  participant I as Intent
  participant E as Embedding
  participant R as Retrieval
  participant K as Ranking
  U->>G: POST /search {"Chennai summer ku comfortable cotton dress venum under 2000"}
  G->>G: cache lookup (key includes catalogue_version)
  G->>I: /parse
  I->>I: script+marker lang-ID → tanglish
  I-->>I: LLM JSON decomposition (if configured) ⟶ normalise to vocabulary
  I->>I: rules: budget ≤2000 · category dress · cotton · comfort · Chennai+summer ⟶ hot_humid
  I-->>G: Intent (+ warnings, parser used)
  G->>G: hard filters = {price≤2000, in stock, category=dress}
  par parallel
    G->>E: e5 query vector (original + English rewrite)
    G->>E: CLIP text vector ("a photo of cotton dress")
  end
  G->>R: /retrieve {BM25 text, e5 vector, CLIP vector, filters, pool=100}
  R->>R: BM25 (filter-aware) ‖ Qdrant ANN (payload filter) → RRF union
  R->>R: complete signals (BM25 for dense hits, cosine for BM25 hits, CLIP visual from stored image vectors)
  R-->>G: candidates with raw signals
  G->>K: /rank {intent, candidates, filters}
  K->>K: re-check constraints · signals (semantic, lexical, visual, occasion, climate, material, comfort)
  K->>K: w(intent): climate×2.07, material×1.8, comfort×1.7, lexical×0.6 (tanglish), occasion→0
  K->>K: score = Σ wᵢ·sᵢ (per-item renormalisation if image missing) → top-k → grounded explanation
  K-->>G: results + weights + rationale
  G-->>U: language · intent · constraints · retrieval mode · weights · products · score breakdown · explanation · timings
